Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.18,0:00:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,夏天到了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.64,0:00:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,今年好像变得有些特别了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.31,0:01:08.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我们昨天来到这个岛上
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.36,0:01:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,进行拍摄Gravity和Procellarum新的PV拍摄中
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.98,0:01:20.53,Default,,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.99,0:01:22.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,耶
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.45,0:01:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,完全跟着对方的节奏走了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.62,0:01:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,还早着呢 现在开始振奋起来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.45,0:01:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,,是 一起加油吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.79,0:01:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,驱
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.75,0:01:34.29,Default,,0,0,0,,阳
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.56,0:01:50.98,Default,,0,0,0,,输了的话今天的饭就拜托了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.27,0:01:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,男子汉一言为定
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.06,0:01:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我们还不一定输呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.98,0:01:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,真不好意思要让我们赢了   小葵
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.74,0:02:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,休息
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.24,0:02:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,交换选手
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.95,0:02:11.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就要结束了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.75,0:02:12.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.71,0:02:15.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我先回去冲个澡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.17,0:02:17.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恩走好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.47,0:02:29.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑国王要登场了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.97,0:02:33.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,羸了始前辈Procellarum才是完全胜利
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.68,0:02:35.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,郁  全力上吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.52,0:02:36.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.99,0:02:44.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.99,0:02:47.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂喂  对方也是拼尽了全力啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.95,0:02:51.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明明是副攻 得分也太多了吧始前辈
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.91,0:02:52.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,暂停
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.37,0:02:54.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,郁君，跟我换一下嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.46,0:02:56.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.46,0:03:04.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,始的球不是我来接的话就太不像话了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.84,0:03:07.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这家伙少说废话
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.01,0:03:11.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,葵
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.14,0:03:14.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,竟然在沙滩上搞时差攻击
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.39,0:03:15.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且速度超快
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.74,0:03:35.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,隼都被调动起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.91,0:03:38.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,水平也不断变高
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.79,0:03:41.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你竟然会来运动  真是稀奇
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.50,0:03:47.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是说了么 接住始的爱是我的使命
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.59,0:03:49.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请把这段剪掉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.93,0:03:52.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才不是爱  好好接球
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.97,0:03:56.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 好 工作人员麻烦剪掉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.81,0:04:00.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接下来由我发球始准备好哟
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.56,0:04:02.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的必杀发球
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.23,0:04:04.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,必  必杀发球？！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.40,0:04:05.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听起来好可怕
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.86,0:04:09.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,必杀  永恒冰峰发球
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.83,0:04:21.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拍摄顺利进行
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.46,0:04:24.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们在工作的同时
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.75,0:04:29.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也享受了夏天海岛和大海的风情
